{"id":"vod_hh_53301","vodId":"53301","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"A.I.C.O.：化身","name_cn":"A.I.C.O.：化身","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/03994131659f561249054ea1c99097f7.jpg"},"summary":"“你……已经不再是人类了。”世界知名影片《交响诗篇艾蕾卡 7》及《我的英雄学院》的动画製作公司 Bones 与《翠星上的加尔冈缇亚》和《钢之鍊金术师：叹息之丘的圣星》的导演村田和也，携手呈献原创生化科幻动作影集。 2035 年的日本，某个研究计画发生了一场名为“大爆炸”的意外，失去控制的人工生命体“大麻烦”因而产生，佔据了整个黑部峡谷。曾被誉为人类希望的研究重镇就此遭政府全面封锁。两年后，在“大爆炸”中失去家人的 15 岁少女橘爱子，从转学生神崎雄哉得知令人难以置信的事实。她的体内隐藏著一个秘密，而一切谜题的解答就在“大爆炸”的中心地“原初点”。少年与少女相遇，人类的命运掌握在两人手中，他们将揭晓什么样的崭新真相？ Netflix 独家，2018 年春季上线。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-01 07:06:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQK4QZd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZGj58a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2qV6Wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4vXgke/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOX4OQb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eV261Oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXX43oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelkGAVd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepoMGmd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwyWPza/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penmKDPd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerqOKWd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:11.749Z"}